        <h1>Current Payment Options</h1>

        <p>OneState currently offers our members every payment option they would expect.</p>

        <p>Apple Pay, Zelle, CashApp, Venmo, paypal, etc are availabe to our members.</p>

        @*<p>Barter Pay allows our members to make the most of past purchases.</p>*@

        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
        <h1>Barter Pay</h1>

        <p>Products and services have value even if it is not a new purchase of goods and services.</p>

        <p>Members are encouraged to buy and trade on a regular basis with a worry free platform for exchange.</p>

        <p>Barter Pay allows our members to make the most of past purchases.</p>

        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->

        <h1>Mattris Funding</h1>

        <p>Most of all member funding activity start with mattris funding.</p>

        <p>Members are not able to fund their own accounts with more than $5.00 until the member is familiar with how member accounts work.</p>

        <p>Mattris funding is a safe and simple way for our members to project funding of all of our member projects.</p>

        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->

        <h1>Nano Ship</h1>

        <p>Shipping costs continue to soar as become more complicated day by day.</p>

        <p>Nano shipping helps us create employment opportunities for our members and allow us to compete effectively.</p>

